The engagement applied a reasonable assurance level for BRSR Core Indicators and a limited assurance level for selected sustainability indicators and claims disclosed in the Integrated and Sustainability Report.

The verification was based on a systematic and evidence-based assurance process limited to the scope stated above. The selection of assurance procedures was subject to the verifier's professional judgement. The procedures performed included, amongst others:

