 Evaluation of the design and implementation of systems and processes for compiling, analysing and aggregating sustainability information;

 Review of the Company's data collection, collation and calculation methodologies;

 Review of the Company's data collection, collation and calculation methodologies;

 Assessment of the appropriateness of quantification methods used for the BRSR Core Indicators and selected IR indicators;

 Review of consistency of data and information within the Report and between the Report and source records;

 Analytical review and inspection of selected sustainability information reported at corporate and site levels;

 Execution of audit trail for selected claims and data streams to assess accuracy in collection, transcription and aggregation;

 Assessment of internal controls relevant to sustainability data management and reporting;

 Review of supporting documentation and evidence on a sample basis; and  Onsite and/or offsite verification at selected locations.

